Grafana Labs traces its GitHub breach to the TanStack npm supply-chain attack attributed to TeamPCP, after which a GitHub workflow token missed during rotation let the attackers in, not to a pull_request_target Pwn-Request misconfiguration. The download was not limited to source code: it included internal repositories with business contact names and email addresses, though not production systems or Grafana Cloud. ShinyHunters denies any link to CoinbaseCartel, whose victim count is 105 by SecurityWeek's reckoning and 170 by The Hacker News's.
